id: pm-starter-nf9u
title: Declare renderer ownership so the host enforces scoping the package only applied at runtime
description: "The renderer overrides self-scoped by checking a private result marker and returning null, which is correct but invisible to the host. Passing the ownership argument makes commands and result ownership enforced before the callback runs."
type: Task
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-08-04T21:44:14.682Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-04T22:14:15.790Z"
closed_at: "2026-08-04T22:14:15.779Z"
completed_at: "2026-08-04T22:14:15.779Z"
author: pi-agent
acceptance_criteria: Both renderer registrations pass a shared ownership object naming the package's own commands and its result discriminator; a test proves the renderer still renders its own marked result and declines a foreign one; coverage stays at 100
resolution: "Renderer ownership enforced by the host before the callback runs; three-axis decline test covers command rejection, result rejection, and both-foreign."
expected_result: A renderer override claims only its own marked results emitted under its own command paths; foreign results and foreign commands fall through to native rendering.
actual_result: "All three decline cases pass for toon and json; dropping the commands array fails the command-rejection case; coverage thresholds met (lines 75.07%, branch 59.49%, funcs 57.41%)."
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-04T21:44:18.600Z",pi-agent,"Derived command path from the api.registerCommand({ name: 'starter demo' }) call in index.ts (line 345). Only the starter demo command emits a starter_demo: true marker that the renderers reshape. The resultDiscriminator reuses the extracted isStarterDemoResult predicate that both the json and toon callbacks already applied inline."
close_reason: "Both json and toon registerRenderer calls pass a shared ownership object naming the 'starter demo' command path plus the isStarterDemoResult discriminator. The decline test is split into three cases that isolate command rejection (foreign command + marked result) from result rejection (owned command + foreign/bare result), with a belt-and-braces both-foreign case, so the commands declaration is independently covered and cannot be deleted with the suite still green."
body: ""
